WEBVTT

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.268
I guess, revelation for me,
where I would have said in the past,

00:18:30.292 --> 00:18:32.893
"Of course, everyone
should have their calendars open.

00:18:32.917 --> 00:18:35.143
No one should need to
hide what they're doing."

00:18:35.167 --> 00:18:37.684
And to me, that's a symbol
of low trust, potentially.

00:18:37.708 --> 00:18:39.643
That if I need to know that I can access

00:18:39.667 --> 00:18:41.809
what everyone else
is doing at every moment,

00:18:41.833 --> 00:18:43.184
that I'm not very confident

00:18:43.208 --> 00:18:45.934
that they're going to do
what they've committed to doing.

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:49.393
EP: It's called totalitarianism.
AG: And that's a surveillance component.

00:18:49.417 --> 00:18:52.893
EP: That's what happened in the regimes
where people spied on everybody.

00:18:52.917 --> 00:18:54.768
It's transparency, it's surveillance.

00:18:54.792 --> 00:18:57.768
It's really not just that I have
nothing to hide kind of thing.

00:18:57.792 --> 00:18:59.559
It's you're entitled to privacy.

00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:01.143
The point is exactly that,